---
import tpoImage from '../assets/images/service-tpo.webp'
import epdmImage from '../assets/images/service-tpdm.webp'
import bitumenImage from '../assets/images/service-bitumen.webp'
import newImage from '../assets/icons/building-construction.svg'
import inspectImage from '../assets/icons/building-check.svg'
import repairImage from '../assets/icons/repair.svg'
---
<div class="container">
  <div class="title-container">
    <span class="reveal reveal-grow"></span><h2 class="section-title reveal reveal-right">Our Services</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="services-grid">
    <div class="description-card">
      <h3>Comprehensive Commercial Roof Installations</h3>
      <p>Whether a new commercial roof, insurance claim, repair or complete replacement, Riverside Roofing Inc comes equipped with decades of expertise, knowledge and the best local roofing technicians to handle the job.</p>
      <div class="flex-container">
        <div class="service-card reveal reveal-up">
          <img src={newImage.src} alt="" class="card-icon">
          <p>New Builds</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card reveal reveal-up">
          <img src={inspectImage.src} alt="" class="card-icon">
          <p>Inspections</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card reveal reveal-up">
          <img src={repairImage.src} alt="" class="card-icon">
          <p>Roof Repair & Replacement</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-container">
      <a class="cta-btn" href="#">See More Of What We Do</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="description-card materials">
    <h3>Modern and Battle-Tested Materials</h3>
    <p>A wide range of factors play into the decision to use a specific roofing technology. Check out our guides below to compare some of the more commonly used roofing materials to help inform your decision.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="articles-grid">
    <div class="card reveal reveal-up">
      <img src={tpoImage.src} alt="" class="card-img">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3>TPO Roofing</h3>
        <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Accusantium dolorum possimus atque, inventore itaque maiores nisi id quae voluptatem amet aut eligendi vitae similique dicta?</p>
        <a class="cta-btn" href=`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/articles/tpo`>More About TPO</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card reveal reveal-up">
      <img src={epdmImage.src} alt="" class="card-img">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3>EPDM Roofing</h3>
        <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Accusantium dolorum possimus atque, inventore itaque maiores nisi id quae voluptatem amet aut eligendi vitae similique dicta?</p>
        <a class="cta-btn" href=`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/articles/epdm`>More About EPDM</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card reveal reveal-up">
      <img src={bitumenImage.src} alt="" class="card-img">
      <div class="card-body">
        <h3>2-Ply Bitumen Roofing</h3>
        <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Accusantium dolorum possimus atque, inventore itaque maiores nisi id quae voluptatem amet aut eligendi vitae similique dicta?</p>
        <a class="cta-btn" href=`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/articles/bitumen`>More About Bitumen</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
.services-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 10px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.articles-grid {
  gap: 30px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
}

.description-card {
  width: clamp(25%, 650px, 100%);
}

.flex-container {
  width: 60%;
  display: flex;
}

.cta-container .cta-btn {
  position: relative;
  font-weight: bold;
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  place-self: center;
  padding: 1.5rem 3rem 1.5rem 2rem;
  margin-top: 0;
}
.cta-container .cta-btn::after {
  content: "\203a";
  font-size: 3rem;
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  right: 10px;
  transform: translateY(-55%);
}
.cta-container {
  place-self: center;
}

.description-card p {
  font-size: 1.3rem;
  margin-bottom: 25px;
  font-weight: 450;
}

.description-card h3 {
  font-size: 2rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  font-weight: bold;
  font-family: 'Roboto';
  color: var(--primary-blue);
}

.materials {
  padding-top: 5rem;
}

.service-card p {
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--primary-blue);
}

.card-icon {
  width: clamp(30%, 50px, 80%);
}

.card h3 {
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .articles-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }
  .services-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  .flex-container {
    width: 100%;
  }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .articles-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  .cta-container .cta-btn {
    font-size: 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 2.25rem 1rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .description-card p {
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .description-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }
}
</style>
